    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "iMOVE Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 30 The Grove, Portmarnock, an exceptional three-bedroom duplex residence presented in turnkey condition within this highly regarded modern development. Offering spacious accommodation over two levels, an impressive south-facing terrace and an A-rated energy-efficient design, this superb home is ideal for first-time buyers, families, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nFinished to an excellent standard throughout, the property boasts bright, contemporary interiors with a layout perfectly suited to modern living. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a stylish open-plan kitchen and dining room with access to a private South facing balcony overlooking landscaped gardens. The living room, to the front of the property has large windows and sliding doors opening onto a generous private terrace. The contemporary kitchen features an extensive range of fitted units, integrated appliances and ample workspace, making it both practical and ideal for entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom complete with a beautifully appointed en-suite bathroom and walk in wardrobe. A second double bedroom and a well-sized third bedroom provide flexible accommodation for family living, guests or a home office. A stylish family bathroom and convenient guest WC complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe Grove forms part of the prestigious St. Marnock’s Bay development, perfectly positioned within walking distance of Portmarnock DART Station, the magnificent Velvet Strand Beach, local shops, cafés and excellent schools. Malahide Village, Dublin Airport and the M50 are all within easy reach, making this one of North Dublin’s most desirable residential locations.\r\n\r\nNo. 30 The Grove represents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious, energy-efficient home in a prime coastal setting, combining contemporary design with exceptional convenience and lifestyle appeal."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n\r\n* A-rated energy-efficient home\r\n* Spacious three-bedroom duplex\r\n* Three bathrooms (including en-suite and guest WC)\r\n* Bright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n* Contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\n* Large private south-facing terrace\r\n* High-quality finishes throughout\r\n* Gas-fired central heating\r\n* Excellent storage\r\n* Designated parking space\r\n* Walking distance to Portmarnock DART Station\r\n* Minutes from Portmarnock Beach\r\n* Easy access to Malahide Village, Dublin Airport and the M50"
      },
      {
